  "about": "The introitus of the formulary “Epiphany of the Lord” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Behold, the Lord and Ruler cometh, and the kingdom is in His hand, and power and dominion. O God, give Thy judgment to the King, and Thy justice to the King's Son. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Ghost. As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be, world without end. Amen. Behold, the Lord and Ruler cometh, and the kingdom is in His hand, and power and dominion." }
